{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07627","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤院学士赐宴得筵字 · 王翰","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤院学士赐宴得筵字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东堂起集贤，贵得从神仙。\n首命台阶老，将崇御府员。\n送人锵玉佩，中使拂琼筵。\n和乐薰风解，湛恩时雨连。\n长材成磊落，短翮强翩翾。\n徒仰蓬莱地，何阶不让缘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}